##### 4c. Deployment showing grace period and probe tuning

```yaml
# k8s/deployment.yaml — grace period sized to the longest safe drain + preStop
spec:
  template:
    spec:
      terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 60   # > worst-case in-flight transfer drain
      containers:
        - name: transfer
          image: nbi/transfer-service:v7
          lifecycle:
            preStop:
              exec: { command: ["sh","-c","sleep 10"] }   # let LB stop sending traffic
          resources:
            limits: { memory: "1Gi" }       # above real peak to avoid OOMKill 137
          livenessProbe:
            httpGet: { path: /actuator/health/liveness, port: 8080 }  # trivial check
            periodSeconds: 10
            failureThreshold: 3              # not too aggressive
```
